  <h2 id="next-step">What to do next</h2>

  <p>
    Pick the target role first, then the language. Read ten postings, run the four questions and build one project you can show.
  </p>

  <p>
    For a first test, spend a focused stretch on one small task in each language, as long as you need, and note which one you finish and enjoy. Some people decide quickly and others need a couple of months, and both are fine.
  </p>

  <p>
    The goal is a high-income skill portfolio, which means the right skill mix, proof of work, clear communication and a fit with how you work. That is what makes the decisions that unlock high income opportunities, and it is what supports an earlier path to financial freedom.
  </p>

